# 🌍 AETHERIA — WORLD EXPLORATION SYSTEM

> **The world is gone.**
>
> But the Tower remembers it.
>
> Inside the Tower of Rebirth exist fragments of the world that was destroyed.
>
> The Master can enter these fragments to explore lost civilizations, discover forgotten history, find survivors, recover resources, and uncover the truth about Nythar.

---

# 1. SYSTEM OVERVIEW

**World Exploration System** adalah salah satu fitur utama dari:

```text
DUNGEON / TOWER SYSTEM
```

World Exploration memungkinkan Master menjelajahi **rekonstruksi wilayah Aetheria sebelum kehancuran**.

Berbeda dengan Dungeon Combat biasa, World Exploration lebih berfokus pada:

```text
Exploration
Discovery
Story
NPC
Character
Resource
Ancient Knowledge
Faction
Hidden Location
Quest
Event
Lore
```

Namun Combat tetap dapat terjadi apabila Master menemukan:

```text
Monster
Cult
Enemy
Boss
Guardian
Hostile Faction
```

---

# 2. WORLD EXPLORATION POSITION

Struktur Dungeon System:

```text
TOWER OF REBIRTH
│
├── Floor Progression
│
├── Dungeon
│   ├── Combat Dungeon
│   ├── Boss Dungeon
│   └── Raid Boss
│
├── World Exploration
│   ├── Ruined City
│   ├── Lost Kingdom
│   ├── Ancient Civilization
│   ├── Lost Dungeon
│   ├── Ancient Battlefield
│   ├── Ancient Academy
│   ├── Forgotten Village
│   └── Unknown Region
│
└── Special Floor Content
```

World Exploration tetap berada di dalam Tower.

